<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-11T14:28:49.060Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis launched missile strikes on Riyadh airport that killed twelve people, including an airline captain, and wounded hundreds, prompting the airport’s closure and Saudi vows of a major response. The Houthis also threatened Saudi airspace and warned they could target other Saudi airports. Yemeni government forces reported advancing against the Houthis as fighting spread to Yemen’s capital and other cities. The EU condemned the Riyadh airport attack as part of Iran‑backed proxy aggression. The conflict caused 918 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/10/yemen-government-allied-forces-recapture-bab-al-mandab-strait-houthis-taiz&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/10/yemeni-governments-military-says-its-forces-advancing-against-houthis?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/09/houthi-missile-strikes-kill-three-at-riyadh-airport-including-airline-captain&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOcWxpNEFaSV9vOWM2b21ROGE1dndweWx6bzlsS2l6MlpiRlh5ODVTX013OW9IcTJNQXRSMWk3SXFvUldfSzdqSUl5LUN4MEhhZEZpM1N5Y1lPajRuS0V0YXBRbjk2Ri05OG0xTXlzaTMyaDlFUHB6ZkZVZUk2SE4yQ0VpZW5UeE5zeG5JUlBUeHN1aG5wb3NoY2Y4UGRicHZWSWE0ZUxhOVBxRjVkQzM0a2YtcTlndw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNVjlrc2t5SHJ4aGYtclhmaXhoVHcxaDJ1TTdIVkk1bXpNT0tnOWtIRFI4ZjNraVZGWG9pNTQ5LWlWdjFQbnlSdnlCQU4yYjNtX0FFZ1RQMFZTMmVmS3V6eHhmNzV0eWFvNnR6a1VpaENvOVNkZWFRaDJLckU0UFU3TVVkYkh1bTdSVEVRb3lQVlVEVUpRRXVMdElkdERBb0lNdG40Yg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNMVhTb3diMTVpQWJwQ2